{"product_id":"thunder-speaker","title":"Thunder Pro Speaker","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"430\"\u003eTurn up the energy with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"209\"\u003eThunder Speaker\u003c\/strong\u003e, built to deliver powerful sound in a compact, stylish body. Designed for music lovers who want loud, clear audio on the go, the Thunder Speaker is perfect for indoor hangouts, outdoor gatherings, and everyday listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"719\"\u003eWith deep bass output, stable Bluetooth connectivity, and long-lasting battery performance, the Thunder Speaker keeps your playlists alive without interruptions. Its durable build and easy controls make it a reliable companion whether you’re chilling at home or heading out with friends.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":51000153309462,"sku":"23304","price":39999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Camou Grey","offer_id":51154395201814,"sku":"24003","price":39999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Thunder_Black01.webp?v=1774944134","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/thunder-speaker","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}